tweets.text:
We’re joining the SGLang consortium as a founding member!

@sgl_project has been the foundation for some of our most demanding inference workloads, helping us to serve trillions of tokens. Along the way, we’ve shared the improvements from our own deployments for everyone to build on.

We’ve bet on open source since the beginning, and we want more engineers to be able to do the same. We’re excited to bring what we’ve learned in production to the consortium.
